SUMMARY:Playdate at the Park
DESCRIPTION:Playdate at the Park with Yolo County Caregivers Collective \n3rd Thursday of every month\, 10am – 11am \nLa Playa Park\, Davis \n  \nCome join us at the park for a relaxed\, free get-together. On the third Thursday of each month\, we’ll visit a different park around the county. (Feb-Winters\, March-Woodland\, April-Davis\, May-West Sac) \nWe’ll gather for an hour full of community\, laughter\, and early childhood fun. Let’s connect\, play\, and enjoy the outdoors together. All ages are welcome! We can’t wait to see you there!
